B.bs8=new A.C("Kaydet ve \xe7\u0131k","D\xfczenlerken de\u011fi\u015fiklikler \u201cKaydet\u201de bas\u0131nca saklan\u0131r. \u201cD\xfczenlemeden \xe7\u0131k\u201da (ya da geri tu\u015funa) bast\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kaydedilmemi\u015f de\u011fi\u015fiklik varsa sorar: Kaydet, Kaydetmeden \xe7\u0131k ya da Vazge\xe7.")
B.bsL=new A.C("Tart\u0131m","D\xfczenle\u2019de \u201cTart\u0131m\u201da bas. Van, \u0130zmir, Ankara, Karaman, Gelibolu, Terazi, Ni\u011fde ve Hatay tart\u0131mlar\u0131 portede ritmi ve oklar\u0131 ile g\xf6sterilir (parantezdeki vuru\u015f bo\u015f ge\xe7ilir). Birini se\xe7, nereye uygulanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 se\xe7 (t\xfcm par\xe7a, se\xe7ili notadan sona, se\xe7ili notan\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc) ve Uygula. Se\xe7enekler (birka\xe7\u0131 birlikte se\xe7ilebilir): \u201cNotalar tart\u0131m\u0131n ritmine girsin\u201d (notalar s\u0131rayla kal\u0131b\u0131n uzunluklar\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131r), \u201cAyn\u0131 perdede tart\u0131mla vur\u201d (her nota kendi s\xfcresinde ayn\u0131 perdede tart\u0131mla tekrar vurulur; ikisi birlikte: her nota bir vuru\u015f al\u0131r ve tart\u0131mla vurulur), \u201cTezene oklar\u0131n\u0131 koy\u201d. Nereye: t\xfcm par\xe7a, se\xe7ili b\xf6l\xfcm (notaya dokun \u2192 \u201cB\xf6l\xfcm\u201d \u2192 son notaya dokun), se\xe7ili notadan sona ya da se\xe7ili notan\u0131n \xf6l\xe7\xfcs\xfc. Be\u011fenmezsen Geri al.")
B.bs_=new A.C("T\xfcm ayarlar","Se\xe7ili notaya bir daha dokun ya da \u201cDi\u011fer\u201de bas: nota ad\u0131n\u0131, oktav\u0131, komay\u0131 ve s\xfcreyi se\xe7ti\u011fin pencere a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.")
B.bup=new A.C("Neler de\u011fi\u015fir","Nota ad\u0131, oktav (\u25b2 \u25bc), koma (pes / tiz), s\xfcre (onalt\u0131l\u0131k, sekizlik, noktal\u0131 sekizlik, d\xf6rtl\xfck, noktal\u0131 d\xf6rtl\xfck, ikilik, noktal\u0131 ikilik, birlik), notay\u0131 silme, \xf6ncesine ya da sonras\u0131na yeni nota ekleme ve oradan \xe7alma. S\xfcre de\u011fi\u015fince arkadaki notalar kayar.")
